     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce75" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">Desde luego, a los FRANKS no les ha faltado curro en Versum Hill</text:span>.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when talking to bel who is skating around</text:p>
