     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce75" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">Hay que ir a *Millennium Square* y, desde allí, pillar el ferry a *Pyramid Island</text:span>*.</text:p>
