     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Únete a la BOMB RUSH CREW.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>O03</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Acumula REP pintando y reta a los FRANKS para obtener información sobre DJ Cyber.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>REP is an ingame mechanic reflected in the UI and dialogue. Stands for reputation. Preferably untranslated</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
